# Backend Fly.io rewrites (proxy /api/* → backend)
/api/*    https://yukpopro-backend.fly.dev/api/:splat    200
/auth/*   https://yukpopro-backend.fly.dev/auth/:splat   200
/health   https://yukpopro-backend.fly.dev/health        200

